  "description": "The crown was never yours to begin with. The one I devoted my entire life to loving. But what I believed to be love was betrayal, My brother, the king, died because of my ignorance, And my homeland collapsed silently and horribly. \n\n*“I've... returned.”*\n\nBut this life will be different. All the glory bestowed upon my uncle shall fade into darkness, and the radiant crown my husband desired shall be taken from him. Even if it burns everything I am, I shall not stop until your blood brightly adorns the path I walk.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
